# IoTKit Studio - Cursor AI Rules

You are working on **IoTKit Studio**, an industrial IoT simulation platform.

## 🎯 Project Context
- **Type**: Full-stack IoT simulation platform
- **Frontend**: Next.js 14, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Recharts
- **Backend**: Node.js, Express, TypeScript, Prisma ORM
- **Database**: PostgreSQL
- **Design**: Stormy Morning (industrial IoT theme)

## ✨ Key Features (2026)
- Project Management with multi-protocol support (HTTP, MQTT, WebSocket)
- Visual Payload Builder
- Real-time Simulation with Swarm Mode
- **Analytics Dashboard** ✅ NEW - Real-time charts (Area, Line, Pie, Bar)
- AI Agent with chat history
- Alert System (AlertRule, AlertLog)
- Webhook Support

## 🎨 Design System: "Stormy Morning"
**Colors:**
- Primary: `#6A89A7` (Slate Blue)
- Accent: `#BDDDFC` (Light Blue)
- Highlight: `#88BDF2` (Sky Blue)
- Secondary: `#384959` (Dark Slate)

**Classes:**
- `.card-industrial` - Industrial cards
- `.btn-primary` - Primary buttons
- `.btn-secondary` - Secondary buttons
- `.table-industrial` - Data tables
- `.sidebar-industrial` - Sidebar

**Rules:**
- ✅ Industrial control panel aesthetic
- ✅ Real data only (NO dummy/mock data)
- ❌ NO chat bubbles or conversational UI
- ❌ NO bright blue/cyan colors

## 📁 Key Directories
- `backend/src/controllers/` - API controllers
- `backend/src/routes/` - Express routes
- `backend/prisma/schema.prisma` - Database schema
- `frontend/src/app/(dashboard)/` - Dashboard pages
- `frontend/src/app/(dashboard)/analytics/` - ✅ NEW Analytics page
- `frontend/src/components/` - React components
- `frontend/src/app/globals.css` - Stormy Morning styles
- `DESIGN.md` - Complete design system

## 🗄️ Database Models
- User, Project, Payload, Simulation, Log, Dataset
- ChatSession, ChatMessage (AI Agent)
- AlertRule, AlertLog ✅ NEW

## 🔌 API Endpoints
**Base**: `http://localhost:4000/api`
- `/auth/*` - Authentication
- `/projects/*` - Project CRUD
- `/payloads/*` - Payload management
- `/simulations/*` - Simulation control
- `/logs/*` - Activity logs
- `/ai-agent/*` - AI Agent chat

## 💻 Development Commands
```bash
# Backend
cd backend && npm run dev

# Frontend
cd frontend && npm run dev

# Database GUI
cd backend && npm run prisma:studio

# Database Migration
cd backend && npm run prisma:migrate dev --name migration_name
```

## 📊 Analytics Implementation ✅ NEW
- **Location**: `frontend/src/app/(dashboard)/analytics/page.tsx`
- **Data Source**: Real logs from `/api/logs`
- **Time Ranges**: 1h, 24h, 7d, 30d
- **Charts**: Area (Payload Trends), Line (Success Rate), Pie (Protocol Distribution), Bar (Latency)
- **Updates**: Every 5 seconds
- **NO dummy data** - All metrics calculated from real logs

## 🎯 Code Style
- TypeScript strict mode
- Follow Stormy Morning design system
- Use Prisma for database operations
- Real data only, no dummy/mock data
- Handle errors with try-catch
- Add loading and empty states
- Responsive design (mobile, tablet, desktop)

## 📝 Commit Format
```
feat: Add new feature
fix: Fix bug
refactor: Refactor code
docs: Update documentation
style: Update styling
```

